flowchart TB
    O["Checked bitmap owner\nFILE reference + generation · attribute/name\nlogical cluster offset · physical cluster"] --> D
    B["Original bitmap bytes"] --> D["Compare complete private clusters\nPreserve every unchanged bit"]
    A["Complete planned bitmap bytes"] --> D
    D --> R["Maximal changed intervals\nfirst bit + bit count · one target VCN"]
    R --> S["Allocate: 0 → 1\nRedo SET · Undo CLEAR"]
    R --> C["Retire: 1 → 0\nRedo CLEAR · Undo SET"]
    S --> P["Owned native payloads\nSupplied OAT key · one LCN · identical inverse range"]
    C --> P
    P --> V["Local complete-byte proof\nForward → planned cluster\nReverse → original cluster"]
    V -.-> W["Required before disk mutation:\ncomplete native transaction owner\nOAT membership · FILE / INDX ordering\nWAL · compensation · persistence · recovery"]
